n localizes to the ER; YEL001C is non-essential; null mutant displays increased levels of spontaneous Rad52p foci	Protein implicated in Mms22-dependent DNA repair during S phase, DNA damage induces phosphorylation by Mec1p at one or more SQ/TQ motifs; interacts with Mms22p and Slx4p; has four BRCT domains; has a role in regulation of Ty1 transposition	
